				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13869050</guid>
				<title>Patience</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13869050/patience</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2020 00:26:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MalyceGraves</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4916887</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><em>It is easier to find men who will volunteer to die, than to find those who are willing to endure pain with patience.</em><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>- Julius Caesar</p> </blockquote> <p>Another step closer to finishing Act II of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/memoria-adytum">In Memoria, Adytum</a>.</p> <p>Thank you to all those Sarkic fans out there who continue to read my scribbles, especially those that have continued to offer support and critique throughout this project. &lt;3</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
