						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <a href="https://youtu.be/SEzghR-QhJI" target="_blank">It looks like the boundless night sky, stars twinkling in droves.</a><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>An ocean locale log-based horror skip! This one was surprisingly inspired by the movie <em>Kaze no tani no Naushika</em> (Nausicaa of the Valley of the Wind). I also remembered that it's sort of post-plagiarizing the Doctor Who episode Fury from the Deep, but I didn't knowingly pull anything from it at all so that's a moot point.</p> <p>Just a little something to keep you guys entertained while I work on my next 90s/alternate 80s Foundation Kojima-inspired SCP.</p> <p>Thanks to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605817541" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605817541" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-dune" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6682213&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605817541" alt="J Dune" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6682213)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-dune" >J Dune</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605817541" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5884163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605817541" alt="Jakob17" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5884163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" >Jakob17</a></span> for looking over this.<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> I'll put the license box in a little bit; I'm still grabbing all the sources again.</p> 
